{"availability":"available","full":"Gogowwww/frp-manager","name":"frp-manager","description":"Self-hosted web panel (GUI / dashboard) for frp: manage frps & frpc tunnels, open ports, nftables firewall, live logs and updates from your browser. Linux, systemd & Docker. Live demo ↓","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":4,"forks":1,"created":"2026-04-18T15:58:06Z","updated":"2026-09-30T09:14:25Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://frp-manager.gogow.fr","topics":["admin-dashboard","docker","firewall","flask","frp","frp-dashboard","frp-panel","frpc","frps","homelab","linux","nat-traversal","nftables","port-forwarding","python","reverse-proxy","self-hosted","systemd","tunnel","web-panel"],"demo":"https://frp-manager.gogow.fr/demo/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T17:26:27.458Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T17:26:27.458Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T17:26:27.458Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T06:44:22.150Z","stars":4,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T07:32:23.818Z","stars":4,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-10T17:26:27.458Z","stars":4,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A self-hosted web UI and dashboard for frp: run frps and frpc from your browser instead of editing TOML files, restarting systemd units and reading logs over SSH.","frp is a single binary configured by TOML files. Running it by hand works well, but day-to-day management stays manual: editing a file over SSH for every new port, restarting the right unit, checking which port is already taken, finding the right log. FRP Manager keeps that model and adds a layer on top of it:","The panel does not replace frp nor change its configuration format: files stay plain TOML that you can still edit by hand, and removing the panel leaves frp running as before."],"features":["Dashboard: automatic detection of frps/frpc systemd services, binaries, configs and Docker containers; start, stop, restart, start 